      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Request Assessment Evaluation\nRegression-test harness for the shared assessment core. Loads representative test cases, compares retrieved sources and AI decisions against expected values, and writes pass/fail results back to the evaluation dataset.  \nThe current baseline contains 6 synthetic cases. Passing all 6 is a regression check, not a claim of production-level accuracy.",
